{
  "ghi_chu": "Me thoi tuong lai (Phase 12A, doi 6). CHEP KHUNG me `hien_dai`: dat, cay, nguoi, ruong, vuon, coi xay (tuabin gio) giu nguyen - chi thay nha, xuong, mo va do vat bang Kenney Space Kit (CC0, tien to sk). Thuoc giong me hien dai: ti_le = min(1.53, 1.9/day, 2.33/cao) tinh tu hop bao cua tung file .obj. Space Kit khong co anh - mau nam trong .mtl (metal, metalDark, metalRed, dark, rock, crystal) nen doi mau bang `mau_vl` theo TEN vat lieu: metalRed la vien nhan dien, moi loai nha mot mau de nguoi choi phan biet. Phai nuong cung so trang, `o_px`, `heSo` voi me hien dai, khong thi `DoiMeAtlas` nem loi luc len doi 6.",
  "ghi_chu_trang": "Me nay xep gon hon me trung co (77,3% mot trang o co 2x) nhung PHAI ra dung so trang nhu no, khong thi `DoiMeAtlas` nem loi luc len doi. Tu 19/09 me trung co can hai trang o 2x vi ba khung coi xay, nen o day dem mot trang rong. Trang dem ghi 1x1 trong suot - khong ton bo nho GPU, khong sprite nao tro vao.",
