  "ghi_chu_dang": "Bang dang cho khung xuong 7 khop cua Kenney mini-characters: root, torso, head, arm-left, arm-right, leg-left, leg-right. Model goc o tu the chu T nen phai ha hai tay xuong (xoay quanh z) va buoc mot chan ra truoc (xoay quanh x). Khung thu hai la ban guong - `doiDang` trong tools/lib/gltf.mjs hieu ca duoi `-left`/`-right` tu 18/09, truoc do no chi hieu `_l`/`_r` nen guong nguoi Kenney KHONG doi chan.",
